own 2026🎾\n\nNew Update!\n\n✈️Compete in the Wimbledon x Emirates Cup for the chance to unlock exclusive rewards.\n🚀Up, up and away with the all new Emirates Jetpack obby!\n🎁Earn limited-edition UGC designed by WhoseTrade - available while supplies last.\n\n😎Switch up your style with all new rackets and gear to kit out your avatar.\n🥇Play with friends and compete against others to gain MMR points.\n📇 Track your stats on the player card!\n\n🌟 Step onto the hallowed grass of the All England Lawn Tennis Club. Meet your heroes, collect coins and compete against friends or AI at the most famous tennis tournament! \n\nTags: Tennis, Sports, Wimbledon","path":"/game/9463737803-wimbleworld","slug":"9463737803-wimbleworld","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/bff90a5513ea9336a247b6f8edc51501600e48843770a4de2c5b890e46fb7193.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-972390d3a0a560c71fc62ebe28fd43f5/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":2,"visitor":32935330,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2022-06-22T16:08:58.024Z","creator":{"name":"Wimbledon Championships","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":7549229959,"name":"[SEASON 2] Squid Game","desc":"📌 Summer Update released, use \"SummerUpdate26\" code for free tickets! 🏖️\n\n🦑 Hey there! You got yourself in some debt and this seems like your only way out. Play the game fairly and don't break any rules, or you'll be 'eliminated'. It is strongly recommended that you forge alliances to survive the intermission nights in-order to win the game.\n\nTags: Squid Game, Fish Game, Hexa Game, Red Light, Green Light!\n","path":"/game/7549229959-squid-game","slug":"7549229959-squid-game","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/776936de15cfbb674bf8a9305c66954f8adc6fb037490f74b061fe324abfc940.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-a5f333c7c41bf9208fbd298c26330504/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":2,"visitor":1991969536,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-01-07T14:27:29.79